            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyahenda obuta bwa Elamu, obu amaani gaabo gahamiraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndyareeta emiyaga ena, ereetwe aha mbaju ina z'eiguru, eteere Elamu, mbataataanisize ei egyo miyaga yoona yaareetwa; kandi tiharibaho ihanga eri abaribingwa omuri Elamu batarizamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndyatiinisiza Elamu omu maisho g'abazigu be n'omu maisho g'abarikumuhiiga. Ndyabareetaho akabi, nikyo kiniga kyangye ekingi; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. Kandi ndyabakuratsa rurara, okuhitsya obu ndibamaraho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bwanyima nte ekitebe kyangye ky'obukama omuri Elamu, ncwekyereze omugabe waabo n'abanyiginya baabo; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.48.47"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 48:47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka omu biro bya bwanyima ndyagarura aba Elamu abaatwairwe bari enkwatwa; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.39"
            ]
